config BR2_PACKAGE_POE_WATCHDOG
    bool "poe_watchdog"
    help
      PoE watchdog daemon for embedded devices.
      Runs a daemon that monitors configured PoE-powered devices via ping
      and power-cycles the corresponding PoE port when the device becomes
      unreachable.

      The package installs /usr/sbin/poe_watchdog, /usr/sbin/poe_ctl.sh,
      /etc/poe_watchdog.conf and the init script /etc/init.d/S99poe_watchdog.
